  "name": "Siril fdiv",
  "description": "Divides the loaded image by the image given in argument. The resulting image is multiplied by the value of the scalar argument. See also IDIV\n\nLinks: idiv\n\nUses fixed input references and writes only invocation-owned outputs. Optional argument values are sent only when their use_* control is true; zero is preserved.",
